  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU through the communication module: address 1, 19200 bit/s, no parity, 1 stop bit by default.",
    "Register numbers are those of the document (40001 shown as 1), sent one lower (address_base 1). All data are holding registers.",
    "Values marked x 10 are sent multiplied by 10; temperatures, pressures and flows are in English or metric units depending on register 316. Two-register values (run hours) are high word first.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's document; not tested on a device."
  ],
